e power of the ancient civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mount &amp; Exploration:</strong> Ride your mount to traverse the forest and hunt for hidden treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Village:</strong> Shape the land, decorate and place buildings</p></li></ul>","developers":["Reyst"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953610/bde7a37e585a160864b9b6afdbb438954ee0ea74/header.jpg?t=1764897583","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2953610/1498068705/6a6d843033b10c0d9abf3782cb2f5cbac0cf7c38/1764896094/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764897461","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2953610/1498068705/6a6d843033b10c0d9abf3782cb2f5cbac0cf7c38/1764896094/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764897461","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2953610/1498068705/6a6d843033b10c0d9abf3782cb2f5cbac0cf7c38/1764896094/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764897461","id":257243803,"name":"Topworld Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite